Package: godeb
Version: 0.1.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: ZeroDos1988 <336650567+ZeroDos1988@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/ZeroDos1988/GoDeb
Depends: libc6, adduser, systemd, ufw, certbot, wireguard, wireguard-tools, qrencode, fail2ban
Recommends: postfix, opendkim, opendkim-tools, pflogsumm
Description: Modular Debian server administration UI
 GoDeb is a local web interface for APT, UFW, Fail2ban, systemd, Certbot,
 WireGuard and an optional Postfix/OpenDKIM mail relay, with mandatory TOTP
 login and optional Microsoft 365 or Google sign-in.
 Accounts, theme preferences, OIDC mappings, WireGuard address assignments
 and mail-relay metadata are stored in an embedded SQLite file. Runtime state
 still comes from the operating system.
